# Studio mode (core/StudioProfile.h), started with --studio tests/data/studio/studio.json (CMakeLists.txt): About names
# the studio and shows its logo, the title bar says its name, AI is off and locked, and the update check reads only
# the studio's mirror (a file here that doesn't exist: nothing is asked of the internet).
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic
run new_sphere subdivisions=3
click "Help##palette.help"
click "About SculptForge##help.about"
expect_text "Studio build for Example Studio"
expect_text "Offline: no outside connections."
shot about_studio
